    rdfs:comment "Laboratory test results collected from clinical trial subjects across study visits. Each record captures a single lab measurement for a participant, including the test performed, the numeric result, reference range boundaries, and an abnormality flag indicating whether the result falls outside normal limits. Used to monitor subject safety and evaluate clinical endpoints during trial conduct." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
